'''Porcupine''' is the fifth one-handed [[Clubs|club]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

Its combination of [[blunt]] and [[Pierce|pierce damage]] makes it struggle to take advantage of weaknesses, as most things that are weak to blunt resist pierce, and vice versa; however, this also gives the Porcupine consistent damage output against most enemies because they will be neutral to both or take more from one and less from the other. 

